},{"verse_key":"67:8","surah":67,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"تَكَادُ تَمَيَّزُ مِنَ ٱلْغَيْظِ ۖ كُلَّمَآ أُلْقِىَ فِيهَا فَوْجٌ سَأَلَهُمْ خَزَنَتُهَآ أَلَمْ يَأْتِكُمْ نَذِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"almost bursting with rage. Its keepers will ask every group that is thrown in, ‘Did no one come to warn you?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"تَكَادُ","en_gloss":"It almost","transliteration":"takādu","verse_key":"67:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَمَيَّزُ","en_gloss":"bursts","transliteration":"tamayyazu","verse_key":"67:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"67:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْغَيْظِ ۖ","en_gloss":"rage","transliteration":"l-ghayẓi","verse_key":"67:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كُلَّمَآ","en_gloss":"Every time","transliteration":"kullamā","verse_key":"67:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أُلْقِىَ","en_gloss":"is thrown","transliteration":"ul'qiya","verse_key":"67:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"67:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَوْجٌۭ","en_gloss":"a group","transliteration":"fawjun","verse_key":"67:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سَأَلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"(will) ask them","transliteration":"sa-alahum","verse_key":"67:8"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خَزَنَتُهَآ","en_gloss":"its keepers","transliteration":"khazanatuhā","verse_key":"67:8"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Did not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"67:8"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَأْتِكُمْ","en_gloss":"come to you","transliteration":"yatikum","verse_key":"67:8"},{"pos":13,"ar":"نَذِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"a warner","transliteration":"nadhīrun","verse_key":"67:8"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٨","en_gloss":"(8)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"67:8"}]},{"verse_key":"67:9","surah":67,"ayah":9,"ar_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟ بَلَىٰ قَدْ جَآءَنَا نَذِيرٌ فَكَذَّبْنَا وَقُلْنَا مَا نَزَّلَ ٱللَّهُ مِن شَىْءٍ إِنْ أَنتُمْ إِلَّا فِى ضَلَـٰلٍ كَبِيرٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They will reply, ‘Yes, a warner did come to us, but we did not believe him. We said, “God has revealed nothing: you are greatly misgui